@page "/about"

<section class="bg-dark text-light border border-secondary rounded p-5 mb-4 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold">About Midnight Groove</h1>
    <p class="lead text-light opacity-75 mb-0">
        An independent record shop for music lovers who still enjoy discovering an album properly.
    </p>
</section>

<div class="row g-4">
    <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-light border-secondary h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h4 card-title">Our Story</h2>
                <p class="card-text text-light opacity-75">
                    Midnight Groove focuses on classic records, timeless artists, and albums that have shaped different generations of music.
                    The idea is simple: every record has a story. Some albums remind people of where they grew up, some introduce them to a new genre,
                    and some become part of their everyday routine.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-light border-secondary h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h4 card-title">Shop History</h2>
                <p class="card-text text-light opacity-75">
                    The shop started as a small local record collection shared between friends. What began as a few shelves of favourite albums
                    slowly grew into a catalogue of rock, pop, soul, jazz, hip-hop, and alternative records.
                </p>
                <p class="card-text text-light opacity-75">
                    The name Midnight Groove comes from the late-night listening sessions that inspired the shop.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark text-light border-secondary h-100">
            <div class="card-body">
                <h2 class="h4 card-title">What We Offer</h2>
                <p class="card-text text-light opacity-75">
                    Users can browse records, view album details, check prices and stock, search the catalogue, and manage the collection.
                    Midnight Groove is designed to make discovering records by title, artist, genre, and release year simple.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

